  "text": "<strong>Slower one keeps low, Khawaja chops on! Raucous roar at Edgbaston</strong>. Three-finger legcutter on a length outside off, Khawaja went across and tried to block it towards cover. The 72mph ball deceived him, it took the inside edge and rattled the stumps. Crawley ran in from cover, fielders swarmed at Stokes who was able to only walk in and continue like one does towards their mark",
